Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 1): init(i1) -> action(n1,"receive the invoice") -> action(n2,"check for mismatches") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n5,"post the invoice") -> converge(c1) -> action(n7,"park the invoice") -> end(e1)
- [N2] Added trace (model 2): init(i1) -> action(n1,"receive the invoice") -> action(n2,"check for mismatches") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n6,"block the invoice") -> converge(c1) -> action(n7,"park the invoice") -> end(e1)
